# The Abandoned Ship (plan 21 · H12, part i): a wreck lying half sunk off Route 108. A slow, lopsided waltz in D minor,
# a music box's tune that has lost its place played on celesta over muted strings, with a low drone that rises and falls
# like the hull settling in the swell and a creak of pizzicato on the off beats, the same by day and night. Original
# composition for this game.
title Abandoned Ship
tempo 84
meter 3/4
reverb 0.48
night none

track box celesta vol=0.62 pan=0.2 rev=0.5
  L o5 d4 f4 a4 | g2 e4 | f4 d4 c+4 | d2. |
  o5 a4 >c4 o5 a4 | a2 f4 | g4 e4 c+4 | d2 r4 |
  o5 f4 e4 d4 | c+4 e4 a4 | o5 b-4 a4 g4 | f2 e4 |
  o5 d4 f4 a4 | g4 b-4 e4 | e4 a4 c+4 | d2. |

track hull strings vol=0.56 pan=-0.15 rev=0.45
  L o4 (d f a)2. | (c+ e g)2. | (d f a)2. | (d f a)2. |
  (f a >c)2. | (d f a)2. | (c+ e g)2. | (d f a)2. |
  (d f b-)2. | (c+ e a)2. | (d g b-)2. | (f a >c)2. |
  (d f a)2. | (b- d g)2. | (a c+ e)2. | (d f a)2. |

